# Feature / assembly / drawing probes are experimental

`src/creopdm/static/feature_probe/`, `assembly_probe/`, and `drawing_probe/` are throwaway Creo.JS experiments used to iterate in Creo.

Production Collect / metadata walks ship from **`creo_inventory/`** (wrapped from those probes). See `.cursor/rules/creo-inventory-metadata.mdc` — do not inline new inventory walks in `base.html`.

## Do not

- Add or restore unit/contract tests for these **probe pages** (`test_*probe*`, or pytest that only targets the probe HTML/JS UX)
- Treat probe-page regressions as requiring the “bug → unit test” rule

## Do

- Edit the probe `.creojs`, try it in Creo, then promote with `scripts/wrap_creo_inventory.py`
- Keep normal app/inventory contract tests on `creo_inventory/` + `gatherModelMetadata` wiring

Iterate by editing the probe files and trying them in Creo. Lessons roll into inventory / the app with normal app tests.
